# The repo's gates (scripts/refresh-manifest.ps1: MD_TXT_CR_TOTAL must be 0) and the
# MANIFEST.txt sha256 hashes assume LF on disk. Without this, a fresh clone on Windows
# with core.autocrlf=true rewrites text files to CRLF and every gate fails.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
